# Context Routing Map ([PROJECT_NAME])

Read when: always at session start.
Skip when: never.

Start with only:

1. `AI_AGENT.md`
2. `docs/SESSION_BRIEF.md`
3. `docs/CONTEXT_ROUTING.md`

Pull deeper docs only on triggers.

## Doc Triggers

| Doc | Load when |
|---|---|
| `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` | scope, milestone, current phase, risk, or next action is unclear |
| `docs/ENGINEERING_RUNBOOK.md` | implementation, commands, tests, CI/CD, verify, or modularity rules are needed |
| `docs/OPERATIONS_RUNBOOK.md` | deploy, secrets, rollback, release, incident, or risk review is needed |
| `docs/TEMPLATE_LIFECYCLE.md` | adoption, migration, validation, placeholders, or upgrade rules are needed |
| `docs/TEMPLATE_INDEX.yaml` | audit inventory or required operating-system artifact coverage is needed |
| `docs/MASTER_TRACEABILITY_TABLE.md` | runtime pathway, smoke evidence, or state mutation coverage changes |
| `docs/AUDITOR_CONTRACT.md` | running or reviewing an audit |
| `docs/ORCHESTRATOR_CONTRACT.md` | choosing the next bounded slice or reviewing packet authority |
| `docs/WORKER_CONTRACT.md` | executing bounded implementation work |
| `docs/REVIEWER_CONTRACT.md` | judging an audit, plan, or result artifact |
| `docs/WORKER_TASK_PACKET.md` | issuing bounded work |
| `docs/WORKER_RESULT_PACKET.md` | reviewing returned bounded work |
| `docs/REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md` | deciding ACCEPT, REPAIR, REJECT, or ESCALATE |
| `docs/STATE_LEDGER_PROTOCOL.md` | packet lifecycle, session budget, or review-state rules are needed |
| `CHANGELOG.md` | documenting or checking behavior history |

## Event Triggers

| Event | Load / Run |
|---|---|
| Startup state feels stale | `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` then refresh `docs/SESSION_BRIEF.md` |
| Audit or retrofit work starts | `docs/TEMPLATE_LIFECYCLE.md` + `docs/TEMPLATE_INDEX.yaml` + `docs/AUDITOR_CONTRACT.md` |
| Next step is unclear | `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` + `docs/ORCHESTRATOR_CONTRACT.md` |
| Implementation starts | `docs/ENGINEERING_RUNBOOK.md` |
| Deploy, release, security, or incident work starts | `docs/OPERATIONS_RUNBOOK.md` |
| New or changed runtime pathway | `docs/MASTER_TRACEABILITY_TABLE.md` |
| Issue a bounded packet | `docs/WORKER_TASK_PACKET.md` + `docs/WORKER_CONTRACT.md` + `docs/STATE_LEDGER_PROTOCOL.md` |
| Worker returns a result | `docs/WORKER_RESULT_PACKET.md` + `docs/REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md` + `docs/REVIEWER_CONTRACT.md` + `docs/STATE_LEDGER_PROTOCOL.md` |
| Final handoff or DONE claim | `docs/REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md` + `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md` |

If more than three deeper docs are needed before the first edit, stop and check whether the task is too broad for one slice.